  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p>다른 선생님께서 올려주셨던 자료를 조금 수정해서 만들었습니다.</p><p>체온조절과 혈당량 조절 과정을 스티커를 붙인 후 친구에게 설명하는 동영상 찍기입니다.</p><p>2인 1조로 짝이 되어 한명은 체온 조절, 한명은 혈당량 조절 과정을 설명하도록 했습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d9818b517eae77944fe1a478ab7dfa5152e6e4f3?download\" data-file-name=\"체온조절,혈당량조절 스티커(폼텍라벨 LS3110).hwp\" data-file-size=\"2331648\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1222%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20241219103752&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fd9818b517eae77944fe1a478ab7dfa5152e6e4f3')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">체온조절,혈당량조절 스티커(폼텍라벨 LS3110)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.22MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv4vmdkwyat0qlrbla1onscj3@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rv4vmdkwyat0qlrbla1onscj3/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33291480920&amp;signature=0yZa6%2BqDx%2Fo6q51ysXO0oFmmNKo%3D&amp;ts=1734572120\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv4vmdkwyat0qlrbla1onscj3?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2NHZtZGt3eWF0MHFscmJsYTFvbnNjajMiLCJ0aWQiOiJlNzI3ZTRiYy0yNTQ1LTRjZmYtOTc4NS1hZmFiM2NjMjEwOTQiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODQyNTZ9.X5IxRw6KxO0ewAuMqf9tG6QpzyPenjra7NYSZMWhMdPwlCppztWxjHTHSMxrPjKJOuM3QUs-LI0EoGosvm1vuQ&amp;autoplay=0\" 